␀␀␀␀# 0.45 Ranked: the matchmaking queue, visible ranks and seasons, talking to the relay's /api rk_* actions
# (relay/worker.js "0.45 ranked"). The relay owns the ratings; this node only shows them, queues, accepts, opens /
# joins the room the relay names (Net.ranked_begin) and reports the result at the end (every human's game does; the
# relay takes the majority). Old relays (no rk_* actions) answer "bad_action": the Ranked card says the server needs
# updating instead of erroring.
#
# The rank maths (tiers, divisions) mirror the relay so a rank can be drawn from a bare mmr; the relay's answer wins.
# Emblems are drawn here (draw_emblem): a shield in the tier's colour with a cut gem, wings for Master, a crown for
# Champion, and division pips (III / II / I) under it. No image files.
class_name Ranked
extends Node

signal changed            # rank info, queue state or caps changed
signal found(q: Dictionary)   # a match was found: the Accept popup
signal result_in(res: Dictionary)   # the agreed result of our last ranked match arrived

